r-2025-2026.pdf","committee":"Governance & Audit & Standards Committee","date":"25/06/2026","key":true},{"title":"Portico Holdings Ltd 2026/27 budget and 2027/28 to 2028/29 forecast","url":"https://democracy.portsmouth.gov.uk/documents/s62878/portico-holdings-ltd-2026-27-budget-and-2027-28-to-2028-29-f.pdf","committee":"Cabinet","date":"23/06/2026","key":true},{"title":"Treasury Management Report and Policy 2026 27","url":"https://democracy.portsmouth.gov.uk/documents/s61943/treasury-management-report-and-policy-2026-27.pdf","committee":"Full Council","date":"17/03/2026","key":true},{"title":"CH Maintenance, Improvements, Non-Dwelling Budget Allocation 2627","url":"https://democracy.portsmouth.gov.uk/documents/s61921/ch-maintenance-improvements-non-dwelling-budget-allocation-2.pdf","committee":"Cabinet Member for Housing and Tackling Homelessness","date":"10/03/2026","key":true},{"title":"Appendices A to F - Budget Book 2026-27 DRAFT (2)","url":"https://democracy.portsmouth.gov.uk/documents/s61922/appendices-a-to-f-budget-book-2026-27-draft-2.pdf","committee":"Cabinet Member for Housing and Tackling Homelessness","date":"10/03/2026","key":true},{"title":"Treasury Management Policy 2026/2027","url":"https://democracy.portsmouth.gov.uk/documents/s61718/treasury-management-policy-2026-2027.pdf","committee":"Cabinet","date":"03/03/2026","key":true},{"title":"Cabinet Budget Recommendation 10.02.26","url":"https://democracy.portsmouth.gov.uk/documents/s61648/cabinet-budget-recommendation-10-02-26.pdf","committee":"Full Council","date":"24/02/2026","key":true},{"title":"Revenue & Capital Budget 2026 27 Report Full Council","url":"https://democracy.portsmouth.gov.uk/documents/s61659/revenue-capital-budget-2026-27-report-full-council.pdf","committee":"Full Council","date":"24/02/2026","key":true},{"title":"Final Revenue Budget Amendment 2026 27 (February 2026 Meeting) - Reform Group","url":"https://democracy.portsmouth.gov.uk/documents/s61804/final-revenue-budget-amendment-2